## Layout reference

- Canonical folders: `00_inbox`, `10_prd`, `20_architecture`, `30_adr`,
  `35_specs`, `40_roadmap`, `50_releases`, `60_customer-feedback`,
  `70_metrics` (plus `99_templates`).
- Every folder has the same subfolder per slot (project). Valid slots are
  listed in `99_templates/skill-bevox-knowledge-contribute/slots.conf`.
- `main` is canon and changes only through human review. This skill only
  ever writes to `draft/*` branches.
